        println!("    - This handshake uses raw unauthenticated Diffie-Hellman (DH).");
        println!("    - While eavesdroppers cannot calculate the shared secret, an active attacker");
        println!("      sitting between client and server can negotiate independent keys with both sides.");
        println!("    - Real TLS solves this with X.509 PKI certificates signed by trusted CAs.");
        println!();
        println!(" 4. PADDING ORACLES & ENCRYPT-THEN-MAC:");
        println!("    - Historic attacks on TLS (POODLE, Lucky Thirteen) exploited CBC padding errors.");
        println!("    - This design eliminates padding oracle attacks entirely by implementing");
        println!("      AES-128-CTR with Encrypt-then-MAC (EtM). Authentication tags cover ciphertext");
        println!("      and sequence numbers before decryption is ever attempted.");
        println!("===============================================================================\n");
    }
